# Charged ollie, Inward Heelflip (J + up right, one press: THPS 1+2's slot for it, and where players press it
# (W D and flip, 2026-11-16); it was J + down left J before, and up right gave a 360 Flip) right after the pop: the
# flip finishes and the combo lands (the view's flip review: ./skate strip --sheet scenarios/flips.strips).
park lab
spawn lab_ledge
hold up 0..60
hold ollie 60..90
tap flip+up+right 96
run 300
expect event trickStart{trick=Inward Heelflip} within 97..97
expect no event trickStart{trick=360 Flip}
expect event trickEnd{trick=Inward Heelflip} within 120..175
expect event comboLanded{name=Inward Heelflip,points=400} within 160..240
expect no event bail
